WEBVTT

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:21.200
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.970
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:32.740
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:37.680
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.520
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:50.200
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:55.900
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:01.070
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:06.880
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:13.390
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:19.060
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:24.200
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.960
Shine the light!

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:56.934
No matter how harsh a path awaits me

00:01:56.934 --> 00:02:01.844
even if the raging wind blocks my way

00:02:01.844 --> 00:02:05.744
as long as I'm with you...

00:02:07.944 --> 00:02:18.294
People have many encounters
determined by a series of coincidences

00:02:18.294 --> 00:02:20.324
and that's how they will
find their emotional support

00:02:20.324 --> 00:02:23.334
and that's how they will
find their emotional support
This is my happiness?

00:02:23.334 --> 00:02:26.164
And that's how they will
find their emotional support

00:02:26.164 --> 00:02:27.804
and that's how they will
find their emotional support
Kasuga-san! Let's get out of here!

00:02:27.804 --> 00:02:29.304
And that's how they will
find their emotional support

00:02:29.304 --> 00:02:33.604
We'll be okay as long as we're together

00:02:33.604 --> 00:02:38.014
Just by believing in those words of yours

00:02:38.014 --> 00:02:39.784
Just by believing in those words of yours
It's not possible, since
you're the child of a Shikabane.

00:02:39.784 --> 00:02:42.214
I can make it to the world I have yet to know
It's not possible, since
you're the child of a Shikabane.

00:02:42.214 --> 00:02:50.624
I can make it to the world I have yet to know

00:02:50.624 --> 00:02:53.824
No matter how harsh a path awaits me

00:02:53.824 --> 00:02:55.394
No matter how harsh a path awaits me
Kasuga-san?!

00:02:55.394 --> 00:02:55.564
No matter how harsh a path awaits me

00:02:55.564 --> 00:02:56.164
even if the raging wind blocks my way

00:02:56.164 --> 00:02:57.994
even if the raging wind blocks my way
Kasuga-san!

00:02:57.994 --> 00:03:00.804
Even if the raging wind blocks my way
Ouri... - kun...

00:03:00.804 --> 00:03:01.304
even if the raging wind blocks my way
Please... make me... a Shikabane... Hime...

00:03:01.304 --> 00:03:06.344
the changing seasons won't wait for me
Please... make me... a Shikabane... Hime...

00:03:06.344 --> 00:03:09.674
I just press forward, hand-in-hand with you
Please... make me... a Shikabane... Hime...

00:03:09.674 --> 00:03:11.244
I just press forward, hand-in-hand with you

00:03:11.244 --> 00:03:16.484
Let's go, I'm not scared

00:03:16.484 --> 00:03:22.724
as long as I'm with you...

00:03:22.724 --> 00:03:23.024
as long as I'm with you...
Nozomi Kasuga's complete
death has been confirmed.

00:03:23.024 --> 00:03:27.014
Nozomi Kasuga's complete
death has been confirmed.

00:03:29.994 --> 00:03:34.734
Which means that she didn't
become a Shikabane and go into action.

00:03:34.734 --> 00:03:38.564
She wasn't suited to
become a Shikabane Hime.

00:04:17.474 --> 00:04:18.874
Hokuto!

00:04:18.874 --> 00:04:21.314
You've finally come to, huh?

00:04:23.284 --> 00:04:30.154
I was worried that Hokuto might
start fretting before you woke up.

00:04:30.154 --> 00:04:32.964
Why haven't you killed me?!

00:04:32.964 --> 00:04:35.224
Why do you think?

00:04:38.934 --> 00:04:41.304
You look mystified.

00:04:41.304 --> 00:04:48.904
Don't you consider me and all
Shikabane Hime enemies to be killed?!

00:04:48.904 --> 00:04:54.644
Thinking gets you nowhere,
right, daughter of Hoshimura?

00:04:54.644 --> 00:04:58.314
Regardless of what we're thinking,

00:04:58.314 --> 00:05:04.784
can you say goodbye
and leave this place?

00:05:17.804 --> 00:05:23.644
Yeah... I may not get such a
perfect chance like this ever again.

00:05:23.644 --> 00:05:25.814
Without any interference...

00:05:25.814 --> 00:05:29.654
You can fight us, the Seven Stars,
to your heart's content.

00:05:29.654 --> 00:05:32.644
Kill to my heart's content, that is.

00:06:00.014 --> 00:06:04.254
Who are you? It's too bright...

00:06:04.254 --> 00:06:06.084
It's hot...

00:06:15.824 --> 00:06:18.824
She's already... gone...

00:06:21.934 --> 00:06:23.934
Do you want something?

00:06:23.934 --> 00:06:27.004
What's the point of this?

00:06:27.004 --> 00:06:31.114
This is because you failed
to decipher the scripture.

00:06:31.114 --> 00:06:33.684
I didn't fail.

00:06:33.684 --> 00:06:37.014
The method for turning someone who's been
a Shikabane for a while, like Hokuto-sama,

00:06:37.014 --> 00:06:42.854
into a Shikabane Hime
wasn't written anywhere.

00:06:42.854 --> 00:06:48.064
Hokuto-sama is the strongest...
no, a being greater than Shikabane.

00:06:48.064 --> 00:06:51.094
And yet, you're having her
fight a mere Shikabane Hime.

00:06:51.094 --> 00:06:53.864
Is there something
you can gain from it now?

00:06:53.864 --> 00:06:56.534
A mere Shikabane Hime?

00:06:56.534 --> 00:07:01.034
It seems like you wasted your time
just chanting sutras at the Kougon Sect.

00:07:02.544 --> 00:07:07.214
The blood of the
Hoshimuras is dark and cloudy...

00:07:07.214 --> 00:07:09.404
in a wonderful way...

00:07:13.984 --> 00:07:16.084
She's still shining.

00:07:49.324 --> 00:07:50.794
That's enough!

00:07:56.864 --> 00:07:58.334
Please wait!

00:07:58.334 --> 00:08:02.534
It's not what it looks like. It was just...

00:08:02.534 --> 00:08:06.204
Gon-Dai-Sojo... Right now, Ouri is...

00:08:06.204 --> 00:08:10.144
He lost control over
his body due to a curse.

00:08:10.144 --> 00:08:12.144
By watching him, it's obvious.

00:08:12.144 --> 00:08:15.214
I'm sorry... Makina has...

00:08:15.214 --> 00:08:20.724
My Shikabane Hime has just...
used her curse somewhere.

00:08:20.724 --> 00:08:23.024
She's fighting.

00:08:23.024 --> 00:08:25.894
She's still connected to me.

00:08:25.894 --> 00:08:28.884
I don't have time for this.

00:08:29.564 --> 00:08:31.894
Please let me go help her!

00:08:32.334 --> 00:08:37.234
I thought I've told you
this before, Sojo Takamine.

00:08:37.234 --> 00:08:40.904
That lad is defiled.

00:08:45.744 --> 00:08:49.514
Breaking the bond? Ouri is a Shikabane?

00:08:49.514 --> 00:08:51.314
That's ridiculous!

00:08:51.314 --> 00:08:53.884
I didn't know, either.

00:08:53.884 --> 00:08:58.654
But it seems like Sojo Takamine
and those above him all knew...

00:08:58.654 --> 00:09:00.894
about that possibility...

00:09:00.894 --> 00:09:03.934
But this may be a good opportunity.

00:09:03.934 --> 00:09:05.164
What?

00:09:05.164 --> 00:09:11.404
Senior Tagami didn't wish
Ouri-kun to come closer to us.

00:09:11.404 --> 00:09:18.004
Though it's late, if we could let
Ouri-kun return to the life he used to live...

00:09:19.614 --> 00:09:20.844
Dammit!

00:09:23.014 --> 00:09:29.184
Maybe we should've killed
the child born of a Shikabane.

00:09:29.184 --> 00:09:30.554
Huh?

00:09:30.554 --> 00:09:35.264
You heard him.
You were born of a Shikabane.

00:09:35.264 --> 00:09:36.624
But...

00:10:20.474 --> 00:10:22.634
You!

00:10:25.414 --> 00:10:26.574
Ow!

00:10:28.284 --> 00:10:35.424
Given where you came from, the Kougon
Sect has never taken measures against you.

00:10:35.424 --> 00:10:38.424
Now that the showdown with
the Seven Stars is coming up soon,

00:10:38.424 --> 00:10:41.014
we will eliminate risk factors.

00:10:41.664 --> 00:10:43.464
We'll dismiss you as a contracted monk

00:10:43.464 --> 00:10:46.154
and break the bond
with your Shikabane Hime.

00:10:46.664 --> 00:10:49.154
I'll leave the rest to the Guardian.

00:10:49.834 --> 00:10:51.164
Yes sir.

00:10:53.874 --> 00:10:57.464
Please listen, Sougi-san! I...

00:11:00.144 --> 00:11:02.544
Now, come!

00:11:02.544 --> 00:11:04.514
Please wait a second!

00:11:04.514 --> 00:11:06.454
Please listen to me!

00:11:06.454 --> 00:11:09.024
I... I!

00:11:09.024 --> 00:11:12.154
I want to go help Makina!

00:11:16.564 --> 00:11:18.964
The child of a Shikabane...

00:11:18.964 --> 00:11:21.334
Am I a Shikabane because of that?

00:11:23.634 --> 00:11:26.504
I want to go help Makina!

00:11:28.844 --> 00:11:30.314
Yamagami-san?!

00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:32.874
Ouri-kun! Now!

00:11:32.874 --> 00:11:34.874
Ah... whoa...

00:11:35.844 --> 00:11:37.074
Huh?

00:11:38.154 --> 00:11:39.344
Go!

00:11:48.394 --> 00:11:50.224
Inspectors...

00:11:51.664 --> 00:11:55.604
What're you doing?!
Takamasa! Ribbon Princess!

00:11:55.604 --> 00:11:57.574
That ritual instrument...

00:11:59.004 --> 00:12:03.244
Is that for breaking the bond
between Ouri-kun and Makina-chan?

00:12:03.244 --> 00:12:06.444
Ouri can't do it by himself yet, so...

00:12:06.444 --> 00:12:09.344
You two are supposed to take
part in that, too, aren't you?!

00:12:09.344 --> 00:12:12.254
Despite that, what do
you think you're doing?!

00:12:15.224 --> 00:12:16.524
I'm sorry!

00:12:16.524 --> 00:12:17.394
Ouri-kun!

00:12:17.394 --> 00:12:18.784
Wait!

00:12:21.264 --> 00:12:24.764
I'm sorry...
but the road is closed from here.

00:12:24.764 --> 00:12:27.704
What're you thinking, Ribbon Princess?

00:12:27.704 --> 00:12:29.434
You two!

00:12:30.574 --> 00:12:33.204
Senior Sougi...

00:12:33.204 --> 00:12:38.764
Could you... please...
give them a little more time?

00:12:43.984 --> 00:12:45.044
Seriously!

00:12:48.884 --> 00:12:52.394
You guys don't understand how we feel!

00:12:52.394 --> 00:12:56.994
He might be better off if he just
quits being a contracted monk, right?!

00:12:56.994 --> 00:12:58.994
Yeah...

00:12:58.994 --> 00:13:03.974
But we thought that he
might be able to find the answer.

00:13:03.974 --> 00:13:05.734
The answer?

00:13:07.844 --> 00:13:11.814
Whether a human and a Shikabane
can have feelings towards each other...

00:13:11.814 --> 00:13:15.404
The answer we couldn't find...

00:13:17.954 --> 00:13:21.974
The answer... has never been in doubt!

00:13:23.624 --> 00:13:24.924
Who's there?!

00:13:24.924 --> 00:13:26.254
Throwing stars?!

00:13:27.494 --> 00:13:30.324
The one who uses such
preposterous things is...

00:13:33.504 --> 00:13:37.304
They're not preposterous...
They have traditional Japanese spirit.

00:13:37.304 --> 00:13:38.974
You meat girl!

00:13:38.974 --> 00:13:42.004
Flesh ninja technique!
Huge throwing star skill!

00:13:42.004 --> 00:13:43.844
Wonderful!

00:13:43.844 --> 00:13:48.184
If both sides don't stop fighting,
I'll show no mercy next time!

00:13:48.184 --> 00:13:50.274
That's enough, Flesh.

00:13:51.014 --> 00:13:52.454
Master!

00:13:53.354 --> 00:13:55.954
Shame on you, Takamasa.

00:13:55.954 --> 00:13:57.994
In the head temple of all places...

00:13:57.994 --> 00:14:01.324
to think you let two
Shikabane Hime fight each other...

00:14:01.324 --> 00:14:03.664
Well, but...

00:14:06.964 --> 00:14:09.064
Your Grace Dai-Sojo!

00:14:09.064 --> 00:14:12.004
That's enough, Umehara.

00:14:12.004 --> 00:14:14.004
We don't have time.

00:14:14.004 --> 00:14:18.014
Ouri Kagami wasn't part
of our plan from the start.

00:14:18.014 --> 00:14:19.314
It's a trivial matter.

00:14:19.314 --> 00:14:20.474
Yes sir.

00:14:21.244 --> 00:14:24.214
Takamasa, come with Itsuki.

00:14:24.214 --> 00:14:25.914
An imperial ordinance has been issued.

00:14:25.914 --> 00:14:26.854
What?!

00:14:26.854 --> 00:14:31.024
We can't allow the Seven Stars
to act freely any longer.

00:14:31.024 --> 00:14:33.324
We'll annihilate them in one shot.

00:14:37.894 --> 00:14:40.934
What am I?

00:14:40.934 --> 00:14:44.394
I can't even rescue Makina
unless I know that.

00:14:49.504 --> 00:14:51.014
So it's okay to start, right?

00:14:51.014 --> 00:14:55.744
Yeah. Kill... Ouri Kagami.

00:14:58.854 --> 00:15:02.854
Once the daughter of Hoshimura
loses her contracted monk,

00:15:02.854 --> 00:15:07.964
she'll lose her soul and become
a Shikabane, who just fights...

00:15:07.964 --> 00:15:11.024
a Shikabane who'd be suitable for Hokuto...

00:15:12.934 --> 00:15:17.134
The Kougon Sect has
gotten active, it seems.

00:15:26.414 --> 00:15:31.084
Shikabane Hime have been concentrated
around the head temple and lkai City,

00:15:31.084 --> 00:15:32.884
the district where it resides.

00:15:32.884 --> 00:15:35.984
It'll become a strong barrier.

00:15:35.984 --> 00:15:40.824
They're probably thinking that we
can't get close to them that way.

00:15:40.824 --> 00:15:46.334
On the contrary, everything
is going as we desired.

00:15:46.334 --> 00:15:47.634
Yes.

00:15:47.634 --> 00:15:52.274
Shikabane will completely defile
lkai City and the awakened Hokuto

00:15:52.274 --> 00:15:58.404
will move straight forward on the
glorious path that was prepared for her...

00:16:00.444 --> 00:16:03.644
until we destroy the Kougon Sect.

00:16:06.484 --> 00:16:07.684
Toya?

00:16:07.684 --> 00:16:11.144
Isaka, don't worry. Just take her.

00:16:17.664 --> 00:16:22.604
It's about to begin! Yes!
This world's hell will begin soon.

00:16:22.604 --> 00:16:26.534
No, that's putting it lightly.

00:16:26.534 --> 00:16:31.164
All the dead will judge the living.

00:16:35.044 --> 00:16:39.854
What I wished is indeed about to begin.

00:16:39.854 --> 00:16:42.354
And yet, why?!

00:16:42.354 --> 00:16:47.324
Hokuto keeps weighing on my mind!

00:16:47.324 --> 00:16:49.484
Why does a Shikabane like her...

00:16:57.204 --> 00:17:01.504
Who are you? Who are you? Who are you?

00:17:01.504 --> 00:17:02.664
What?!

00:17:07.144 --> 00:17:14.214
Let go of me! You! You!
You... you... you... you... you... you!

00:17:34.504 --> 00:17:36.374
I'm not done yet!

00:17:40.344 --> 00:17:41.444
Who are you?!

00:17:41.444 --> 00:17:44.014
I'm someone whom you killed!

00:17:44.014 --> 00:17:45.914
Who?! Who?!

00:17:45.914 --> 00:17:48.924
Tell me! Tell me! Tell me!

00:17:48.924 --> 00:17:52.394
Is it possible that she
wants to know who she is?

00:17:52.394 --> 00:17:55.084
She doesn't even know that?!

00:17:56.624 --> 00:18:00.564
You are Hokuto of the Seven Stars...

00:18:00.564 --> 00:18:02.294
my enemy!

00:18:13.644 --> 00:18:17.154
Enemy... Enemy... Enemy!

00:18:17.154 --> 00:18:20.484
I am... your... enemy...

00:18:20.484 --> 00:18:23.654
Your... Your...

00:18:23.654 --> 00:18:24.914
enemy!

00:18:29.764 --> 00:18:31.994
I wonder if there really is nothing...

00:18:33.094 --> 00:18:34.964
What're you doing?!

00:18:34.964 --> 00:18:36.404
Oh, well, I...

00:18:36.404 --> 00:18:38.564
Ouri...

00:18:39.004 --> 00:18:39.994
Argh!

00:18:42.074 --> 00:18:43.974
Ow!

00:18:43.974 --> 00:18:45.944
Why didn't you stop?

00:18:45.944 --> 00:18:47.744
I'm sorry.

00:18:47.744 --> 00:18:51.414
When I saw you, I got upset for
some reason, so I hit you by mistake.

00:18:51.414 --> 00:18:53.004
Why?!

00:18:53.284 --> 00:18:57.294
You've been back in town for a while
since you finished your training, right?

00:18:57.294 --> 00:18:58.274
Ah...

00:18:58.824 --> 00:19:02.164
And yet, you haven't even stopped by.

00:19:02.164 --> 00:19:03.784
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.334 --> 00:19:07.534
Have dinner with us tonight, okay?

00:19:07.534 --> 00:19:13.304
The kids are at the park playing right now,
but I think they'll be back soon.

00:19:13.304 --> 00:19:15.474
Ah, yeah.

00:19:15.474 --> 00:19:18.314
So what were you looking for?

00:19:18.314 --> 00:19:20.214
What? Ah...

00:19:20.214 --> 00:19:25.314
I wondered if Brother left something...
that tells about me...

00:19:27.654 --> 00:19:29.524
About that day?

00:19:29.524 --> 00:19:31.894
I know it's kinda late, but...

00:19:31.894 --> 00:19:37.894
I really wanna know...
why I was brought here...

00:19:37.894 --> 00:19:43.004
Of course...
but I really don't know anything.

00:19:43.004 --> 00:19:45.834
I heard that most
of the children who came here

00:19:45.834 --> 00:19:51.574
lost their parents or had a
difficult situation at home...

00:19:51.574 --> 00:19:52.314
Ah!

00:19:52.314 --> 00:19:53.344
What is it?

00:19:53.344 --> 00:19:58.014
Come to think of it, around that time,
there was a rash of missing children.

00:19:58.014 --> 00:19:59.644
Missing?

00:20:00.584 --> 00:20:05.824
Children went missing one
after another in this area.

00:20:05.824 --> 00:20:08.594
They might've been kidnapped.

00:20:08.594 --> 00:20:11.564
But no one was arrested for that.

00:20:12.164 --> 00:20:16.034
So, although Keisei didn't say anything,

00:20:16.034 --> 00:20:21.004
I thought you might've
been involved in that case.

00:20:21.004 --> 00:20:22.544
But it's strange...

00:20:22.544 --> 00:20:27.284
because he would've taken you to your
own parents if that was the case, right?

00:20:27.284 --> 00:20:29.274
Missing children?

00:20:32.854 --> 00:20:34.454
Riko!

00:20:34.454 --> 00:20:35.254
Hina got!

00:20:35.254 --> 00:20:35.954
What?!

00:20:35.954 --> 00:20:36.854
Ouri!

00:20:36.854 --> 00:20:38.844
What happened to Hina?!

00:20:39.554 --> 00:20:43.084
Hina got snatched!
By a guy with scary eyes!

00:20:50.204 --> 00:20:54.044
He is... calling you, Ouri...

00:20:54.044 --> 00:20:55.144
He?

00:20:55.144 --> 00:20:57.444
Our...

00:20:57.444 --> 00:20:59.104
brother...

00:21:15.894 --> 00:21:17.964
Hey, brother!

00:21:17.964 --> 00:21:18.964
What?

00:21:18.964 --> 00:21:24.504
I thought you might remember it if
I create the same situation as that time.

00:21:24.504 --> 00:21:26.474
The same situation as that time?

00:21:26.474 --> 00:21:32.174
It's the same situation, right?
As the time when your mother killed us!

00:21:32.174 --> 00:21:33.164
Ah!

00:21:42.484 --> 00:21:50.154
When we all died...
why are you, just you, alive?!

00:21:55.334 --> 00:22:02.944
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:02.944 --> 00:22:06.974
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:06.974 --> 00:22:14.684
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:14.684 --> 00:22:22.614
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:25.294 --> 00:22:31.074
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:31.074 --> 00:22:37.004
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:37.004 --> 00:22:42.844
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:42.844 --> 00:22:48.654
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:48.654 --> 00:22:53.724
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:53.724 --> 00:23:01.504
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:01.504 --> 00:23:05.534
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:05.534 --> 00:23:13.214
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:13.214 --> 00:23:21.084
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:25.754 --> 00:23:30.464
Countless die for one to live.

00:23:30.464 --> 00:23:33.964
That's right. Your life is no exception.

00:23:33.964 --> 00:23:37.404
Hesitate and resist. And find...

00:23:37.404 --> 00:23:40.064
"the value of the living."
